><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>We recommend that clinicians and patients use the term tendinopathy&#xD;to refer to persistent tendon pain related to mechanical&#xD;loading.</span
></p
></body
